---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

import AdsterraBanner from '../../components/AdsterraBanner.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Opal Rokakaka (Opal Roka) in Stand Out – How to Get, Evolution & Gardening | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Master guide for Opal Rokakaka (Opal Roka) in Roblox STAND OUT. Learn how to grow it via greenhouse gardening mutation, awaken Star Platinum: The World (SPTW) and TWAU, and level 50 requirements."
  canonicalPath="items/opal-rokakaka"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Items', href: '/items/' },
    { label: 'Opal Rokakaka' }
  ]}
  schemaType="Article"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <!-- Header Badge & Title -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 border border-emerald-200">
        <span>Mythical Botanical Mutation</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Stand Evolution Catalyst</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Opal Rokakaka (Opal Roka) in Stand Out
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        The <strong>Opal Rokakaka</strong> (commonly referred to by players as <em>Opal Roka</em>) is the most sought-after fruit mutation in Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong>. It acts as the primary botanical catalyst required to evolve baseline Pinnacle Stands into their ultimate awakened forms.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Top Above-The-Fold Adsterra Native Banner -->
    <AdsterraBanner className="mb-10" />

    <!-- Quick Fact Summary Card -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs mb-10">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Item Category</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">Rokakaka Mutation</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Primary Purpose</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-emerald-700 mt-1">Stand Evolution (SPTW / TWAU)</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Required Level</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-rose-700 mt-1">Max Level 50 Cap</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Main Source</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-purple-700 mt-1">Greenhouse Gardening</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Primary Function: Stand Evolution -->
    <section class="mb-12 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        What Does the Opal Rokakaka Do?
      </h2>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Unlike standard Rokakaka which completely wipes your current Stand, or Pure Rokakaka which resets your allocated skill points, the <strong>Opal Rokakaka</strong> catalyzes genetic equivalent exchange to trigger Stand Awakenings:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span>
              Star Platinum &rarr; Star Platinum: The World (SPTW)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Consuming an Opal Roka while possessing a max-level Star Platinum initiates the awakening ritual, unlocking the full Time Stop dimension and devastating Ora Beatdown moveset.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-600"></span>
              The World &rarr; The World: Alternative Universe (TWAU)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Used in conjunction with Diego's dimensional relics to cross the boundary into the Steel Ball Run universe, converting The World into its agile knife-throwing and gasoline-igniting variant.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-rose-900 text-xs">
          <strong>Important Requirement:</strong> You must reach the character level cap of <strong>Level 50</strong> before consuming an Opal Rokakaka. Consuming it at lower levels will only induce stone petrification without triggering the evolution script!
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How to Obtain / Gardening Guide -->
    <section class="mb-12 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        How to Get Opal Rokakaka in Stand Out
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs">Method 1</span>
            Greenhouse Gardening Mutation (Highest Yield)
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            The most reliable and repeatable way to obtain Opal Rokakaka is through the Honolulu Community Greenhouse gardening system:
          </p>
          <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 pl-2">
            <li>Purchase standard <strong>Rokakaka Seeds</strong> from the botanical vendor for $1,200 Dalas.</li>
            <li>Plant them in a Greenhouse plot enriched with <strong>High-Grade Mineral Fertilizer</strong>.</li>
            <li>Maintain moisture levels between 70% and 90% during all three growth stages.</li>
            <li>Each harvested plant rolls a <strong>3.5% mutation chance</strong> to produce an Opal Rokakaka instead of a standard fruit.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 text-xs">Method 2</span>
            Endgame Raid MVP Chests
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Completing high-difficulty raids like the <em>Passione Train Raid</em> or <em>77 Rings Raid</em> on Nightmare difficulty grants team MVPs a chance to roll an Opal Rokakaka directly from the victory reward cache.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs">Method 3</span>
            Underground Merchant Restock
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            The black market trader in the Honolulu storm drains occasionally restocks an Opal Roka during midnight game ticks for $50,000 Dalas. Stock is limited to 1 per server cycle.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cross Navigation Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <a
        href="/rokakaka/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Fruit Database</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">All Rokakaka Fruits →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Compare Standard, Pure, Attractive, and Carbonated Roka types.</p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/guides/evolve-stands/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Step-by-Step Guide</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Stand Evolution Guide →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Complete tutorial for awakening SPTW and TWAU in STAND OUT.</p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/gardening/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Farming System</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Gardening &amp; Mutation Guide →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Learn seed growth timers, watering formulas, and plot upgrades.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
